{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29998","headline":"早秋寺居酬张侍御六韵见寄 · 喻凫","name":"早秋寺居酬张侍御六韵见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六十上清冥，晓缄东越藤。\n山光紫衣陟，寺影白云凝。\n湿叶起寒鸟，深林惊古僧。\n微风窗静展，细雨阁吟登。\n清韵岳磬远，佳音湖水澄。\n却思前所献，何以豸冠称。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}